    "message": "Let installed tools use the final approved SDK contracts safely\n\nThe Registry now exposes 53 approved contracts; History and permission requests remain trusted Host-only. Reuse the existing Scheduler, installation authority and RunHost, and derive the four-layer ledger from the real Registry.\n\nConstraint: main only; one Registry, Host, Scheduler and Authority; preserve parallel edits\nRejected: Historical hardcoded counts or a second runtime | would bypass the actual contract and ownership checks\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: moderate\nDirective: Native acceptance remains separate; never promote Node or build evidence to Chrome PASS\nTested: SDK CI explicit Node 201/201; SDK and scheduler Node 193/193; strict matrix/catalog/coverage/ledger; Check; production/development/size/Verify\nNot-tested: Full same-candidate native acceptance, fixed-task Scheduler runs twice, real permission denial and Worker restart; extra full-repo run has 21 failures outside this scoped CI suite",
